### ========================
### TASK CONTROLLER TESTS
### ========================

### Get all tasks (Success)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Get task by ID (Success)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### Get task by ID (Fail: 404 Not Found)
# Trying to get a non-existing task
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/9999
Accept: application/json

### Create a new task (Success)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "New Task",
  "description": "This is a test task",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "energyCost": 10,
  "damage": 5,
  "procrastinationDamage": 2,
  "creationDate": "2025-11-13",
  "parents": []
}

### Create a new task (Fail: 422 Invalid Task)
# Missing required fields
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing title and status",
  "energyCost": 0,
  "damage": -5,
  "procrastinationDamage": 0,
  "creationDate": "2025-11-13"
}

### Update an existing task (Success)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Task",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "energyCost": 12,
  "damage": 6,
  "procrastinationDamage": 3,
  "creationDate": "2025-11-13",
  "parents": [3]
}

### Update task (Fail: 404 Not Found)
# Updating non-existing task
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/9999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Task",
  "description": "Non-existing",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "energyCost": 12,
  "damage": 6,
  "procrastinationDamage": 3,
  "creationDate": "2025-11-13",
  "parents": []
}

### Update task (Fail: 422 Invalid Task)
# Invalid fields
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "energyCost": 0,
  "damage": -1,
  "procrastinationDamage": 200,
  "creationDate": "2025-11-13"
}

### Delete a task (Success)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/3